<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About Us | White Water Rafting Adventures</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Learn about White Water Rafting Adventures, our river history, mission, and guided white water rafting experiences.">
  <meta name="author" content="Your Full Name">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles/rafting.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <img src="images/logo.png" alt="White Water Rafting Logo">
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About Us</a>
      <a href="trips.html">Trips</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact Us</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <img src="images/hero.jpg" alt="Rafting crew paddling through white water rapids">
      <h1>White Water Rafting Adventures</h1>
      <article>
        <img src="images/happy-client.jpg" alt="Smiling paddler on a rafting trip">
        <p>Our mission is to share the thrill and natural beauty of white water rafting safely with every guest, from first-time rafters to seasoned river runners.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2>History</h2>
      <p>Founded with a single raft and a commitment to river safety and conservation, White Water Rafting Adventures has guided adventurers through scenic canyons for years while protecting local waterways.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Adventure Awaits You!</h2>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 | White Water Rafting Adventures | Your Full Name</p>
    <nav class="socialmedia">
      <a href="https://facebook.com">
        <img src="images/facebook.svg" alt="Facebook">
      </a>
      <a href="https://twitter.com">
        <img src="images/twitter.svg" alt="Twitter">
      </a>
      <a href="https://instagram.com">
        <img src="images/instagram.svg" alt="Instagram">
      </a>
    </nav>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
